OL,3,AStorm Boelo leaves 90,000 without power
OL,4,Aas Met Office issues new wind warning
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Office has issued a yellow
OL,7,Fwarning for strong winds from 18:00 on
OL,8,FMonday to 03:00 on Tuesday across the
OL,9,Fwest coast of England, Wales and
OL,10,FScotland and eastern parts of Northern
OL,11,FIreland.
